# Line endings are load-bearing in this repo, which is unusual and worth stating.

# 1. prove_bites compares the subject against a clean twin BY CONTENT. The twin is
#    supplied by the caller and is not stored here. If a checkout converts line
#    endings, the target and the twin differ across the whole file and the hunk
#    count becomes meaningless -- the pair stops being a control.
# 2. tests/arms.py compares a mutated subject against src/ by content. A checkout
#    that rewrites line endings on one side and not the other turns a clean tree
#    into a false "undeclared difference" and the harness refuses.

# Pin LF everywhere so the bytes on disk are the bytes in the blob.
* text=auto eol=lf
